{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5723cc779483262d08a585035b807ad0de57d3d9783ee789b735cf4a7cc5e573","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37ebbe06ca62c038ba80803ebb5a6e0be5b15cea727e815064063b3d9169d676"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"The app reads Claude Code conversation logs from ~/.claude/projects/<project>/<session-id>.jsonl JSONL files and automatically discovers new projects and sessions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5a1107dda98ff15127b004cd1344fbbad907ac83e0de2cced33132769a78917c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05c0575ce9b028737c2a6e6345c5fab6c85d2db958d6038c9c0a94084fc1ae58"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"The product includes an integrated terminal emulator in a bottom panel, letting users launch Claude Code from the browser without leaving it.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_746ef0fe0c9accc687c12d9e413503b3793e5ba8d1732072afdcad8f150a61a5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_81306a6b389efed831b94da605291ebf7c34ede7e06aa89ce069e4c9fbc44d8c","slc_8c25ee66122085212697ea4ba482352a6d5d74d53112213aa3110ed343b1a2ea"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"Conversation data is preserved through strict Zod schema validation, with a progressive-disclosure UI that reveals details on demand.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8265f2721d7e550113969bba288222b30882bdf6e1c101229720a3e9744bed4a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_02e5775f4e891037251df13f0b0abadb5aad0959107d94b869d0e5d12232944a"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"Authentication is a simple single-password mechanism without multi-user support, role-based access control, or OAuth; more sophisticated access control is left to infrastructure like reverse proxies or VPNs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8ccf7a6c54579992915405c6872f10fe6159e863d602ff78a992e9fd81ad6d70","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2bac14ef13f07dd1e33dd7b6eb50de4faae9401e890ac24020874647c1f52c4e"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"It is a PWA supporting Add to Home Screen on mobile with an optimized UI and push notifications when sessions complete.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c19be55894d6b155d12bce17b5c562df6ddd5866e7c7fa9a8bf1bb147037ea66","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7fb973dda9fd19288b106890fc6fe67854d5f649fa56d71f82e176173b64c5be","slc_ec83c77e4f3518550527a1357115e359ddd3776af204774deeff549fef48b2df","slc_f0f21462de98e2834bd4228ab3c081fc8a4fa6c5a2b40322022b57265ed8fef7"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"When a password is configured, /api routes require authentication via a ccv-session cookie from /api/auth/login or an Authorization: Bearer header; without a password, API auth is disabled.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e07fa3d4ceb04642151a02c248f057b4661abbcc030e20ac4b81dac0d9891b37","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"d-kimuson/claude-code-viewer@9367cf006be9 snapshot d2e4b2b80b9562f7","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1319d946bb81546f6178e4161503526b1a7e145778c553fad4e4881ab9344767"],"source_ids":["src_b38396e590ec5341831a0c43366658e9"],"text":"Due to Anthropic ToS ambiguity for subscription accounts, chat sending, session resuming, permission approval, and AskUserQuestion are opt-in; read-oriented features work independently of the Agent SDK.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:44:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_26ffd482152b4679b5a9c5ba9f00f9fb"}
